{"id":1222,"date":"2021-03-19T01:30:22","date_gmt":"2021-03-19T01:30:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=1222"},"modified":"2021-03-19T15:28:29","modified_gmt":"2021-03-19T15:28:29","slug":"rdrc-launch-new-learning-opportunity-programs","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-launch-new-learning-opportunity-programs\/","title":{"rendered":"RDRC Launch New Learning Opportunity Programs"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Fresh Programs For The Rockaway Community<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">After a year of providing remote learning courses, RDRC will be offering limited space, in-person learning opportunities for Rockaways residents. To protect us, RDRC follows strict Centers for Disease Control (CDC) guidelines and will limit the number of students attending or being present in our offices. RDRC will require all students to provide a recent COVID-19 negative result before the course start date and wear and keep-on masks. Our office sanitized periodically and the classroom daily.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Neighborhood Preservation Services Certified 1st Time Home-Buyers<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\" data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">For persons interested in learning about the homebuying do\u2019s and don\u2019ts, or for persons that must satisfy a mortgage lenders\u2019 requirement to obtain training from a certified Housing &amp; Urban Development (HUD) certified housing counseling agency, RDRC has the answers.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Our 12-hour course will be offered in-person in two-sessions held from <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1wgjCqnb1XWakVhLefxeHXjDfRD5Mhy0I\/view\">9:00am to 3:00pm on Saturday, March 20th and Saturday, March 27th. <\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Career &amp; Workforce Development\u00a0Certified OSHA Certification<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\" data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">For Far Rockaway and Edgemere residents interested in beginning a career in the construction trades, RDRC offers a combined 46-hour OSHA approved course that includes: OSHA 30, OSHA Flagger and OSHA SST (Site Safety Training) plus a required 2-hour job readiness class. Courses held from 9:00am to 5:00pm on the following dates:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Monday, March 22nd<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Tuesday, March 23rd<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Wednesday, March 24th<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Thursday, March 25th<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Friday, March 26th<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Monday, March 29th<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Certified Customer Service Course<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">For Rockaways residents, RDRC is hosting a free-certified Customer Service Specialist course for persons interested in careers in retail, food industries, office administration, hotel, airline and Helpdesk. The course is certified by the National Retail Foundation and recognized by retail, foodservice and professional service companies internationally. The 10-hour course also includes our 2-hour job readiness and financial education classes. The courses are from 9am to 3pm on Monday, March 15th through Thursday, March 18th.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">For more information about our upcoming classes, please call 718.327.5300 or email us at\u00a0<a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #000080;\" href=\"nfo@rdrc.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">i<span style=\"color: #b87614;\">nfo@rdrc.org<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered"